      "writtenOn": "2026-02-13T14:04:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s a bit weird that this CL implements the deferred path but it has no test coverage. Many of these multi-threaded tests don\u0027t work with deferrals because they use `Queue::Submit` on multiple threads. Whereas our deferred path only expects `Queue::Submit` to run on a single thread (i.e. the GL thread). That\u0027s also the reason why originally I added a lock to the deferred path.\n\nMaybe we should at least add some tests to verify the deferred buffer mappings can work on multiple threads without using `Queue::Submit`. The existing `Buffers_MapInParallel` test uses `Queue::Submit` concurrently, so we cannot enable that.\n\nI think we could also enable some tests like `BufferTests.cpp`, `CopyTests.cpp`, etc for \"gl_defer\" toggle. Those can verify `Queue::WriteBuffer`, `Queue::WriteTexture` implementations. They are single threaded tests and don\u0027t have problem with `Queue::Submit`. \n\nCould do in the follow up CLs as well.",
